#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:29
#: 2b83116a546e4bf4af6cff52b0e7ff95
msgid "Retrieving All Parameters"
msgstr "获取所有参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:31
#: 74131b305c0d4192a4b0ab1fe444d0ec
msgid ""
"The most efficient way to receive all parameters is to send a "
"`PARAM_REQUEST_LIST "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_LIST>`__ message "
"with the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"接收所有参数最有效的方式是发送一条包含如下字段的 `PARAM_REQUEST_LIST "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_LIST>`__ 消息："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:33
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:50
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:62
#: 050835c16ced403abf3bc0b22f7c1522 b5f93adb6dc847e0b39e104b9ee25da2
#: d08e691c542a4610badd357bb9ee19a4
msgid "**target_system** : the MAVLink system id of the vehicle (normally \"1\")"
msgstr "**target_system**：飞行器的 MAVLink 系统 ID（通常为 「1」）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:34
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:51
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:63
#: 3445a5bd47e44c55908d865492f48dac 75adc55c90f44594987da852c0a18129
#: be714eb2707c4dc0831c9c05e374cf28
msgid "**target_components** : normally \"1\""
msgstr "**target_components**：通常为 「1」"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:36
#: 3cea9b95495b43e6a3966274ea3ba00d
msgid ""
"The vehicle should respond with many individual `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ messages (one "
"for each parameter in the system).  The fields of the `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ messages are:"
msgstr ""
"飞行器应回应多条各自独立的 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ "
"消息（系统中每个参数对应一条）。`PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息的字段如下："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:38
#: 2dfb523e3b0e44f49c72332c733d6b0c
msgid ""
"**param_id** : the parameter name, a 16 character string (null terminated if"
" less than 16 characters)"
msgstr "**param_id**：参数名称，一个 16 字符的字符串（不足 16 字符时以 null 结尾）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:39
#: ec4c3aa94271428d9c5c4582e052b6af
msgid ""
"**param_value** : the parameter value (all parameter values are sent as "
"floats)"
msgstr "**param_value**：参数值（所有参数值均以浮点数形式发送）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:40
#: ed558f97261543dcb7e02405b344d8e9
msgid ""
"**param_type** : the `MAV_PARAM_TYPE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_PARAM_TYPE>`__.  Note that "
"ArduPilot only supports MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT8, MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT16, "
"MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT32 and MAV_PARAM_TYPE_REAL32 (aka float) types."
msgstr ""
"**param_type**：`MAV_PARAM_TYPE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_PARAM_TYPE>`__。注意 ArduPilot "
"仅支持 MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT8、MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT16、MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT32 和 "
"MAV_PARAM_TYPE_REAL32（即 float）类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:41
#: e6b6b40ac7534fe49823ef3613adabcc
msgid ""
"**param_count** and **param_index** fields should be used to determine if "
"all parameters have been successfully received"
msgstr "**param_count** 和 **param_index** 字段应用于判断是否已成功接收全部参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:43
#: 9ab3a98567d443208198dab9c0629349
msgid ""
"MAVLink does not guarantee delivery of packets so if some parameter values "
"do not arrive, use the instructions below to re-request the missing "
"parameters."
msgstr "MAVLink 不保证数据包的可靠投递，因此若某些参数值未能到达，请按照以下说明重新请求缺失的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:46
#: c020b65336944430a8d3e0cc0c0e602b
msgid "Retrieving a Parameter"
msgstr "获取单个参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:48
#: cad84f859245428f838c54accdd77ef5
msgid ""
"To retrieve just a single parameter send a `PARAM_REQUEST_READ "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_READ>`__ message "
"with the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"若只需获取单个参数，请发送包含如下字段的 `PARAM_REQUEST_READ "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_READ>`__ 消息："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:52
#: 43944efd0b5444be9e15138197208e42
msgid ""
"**param_id** : the human readable 16 character parameter name if known.  If "
"not known, this field can be anything as long as the param_index is set to a"
" non-negative number"
msgstr ""
"**param_id**：若已知则填写人类可读的 16 字符参数名称。若不知道，只要 param_index 设置为非负数，该字段可以填任意值"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:53
#: 93479708a100443ea167fc29f58eee6d
msgid ""
"**param_index** : the parameter index number or -1 if the \"param_id\" field"
" should be used instead.  Note that it is better to use the param_id field "
"because this index may change if \"hidden\" parameters are exposed (see "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"**param_index**：参数的索引编号；若应使用 「param_id」 字段则填 -1。注意，最好使用 param_id 字段，因为当 「隐藏」"
" 参数被公开（见下文）时，该索引可能发生变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:55
#: 9e3eb7fb917f4750bd4a51d393f3c608
msgid ""
"The vehicle should respond with a `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ message as "
"described in the section above."
msgstr ""
"飞行器应以上述章节中描述的 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息作为回应。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:58
#: 3474ba95a26d49d9a35a922ec6d27505
msgid "Setting a Parameter"
msgstr "设置参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:60
#: 40aa0a8615b94437ae24eec552a69dcc
msgid ""
"To set the value of a single parameter send a `PARAM_SET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_SET>`__ message with the "
"following fields:"
msgstr ""
"若要设置单个参数的值，请发送包含如下字段的 `PARAM_SET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_SET>`__ 消息："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:64
#: c121ef23f7ce4fc19584973eda5ac03e
msgid "**param_id** : the human readable 16 character parameter name"
msgstr "**param_id**：人类可读的 16 字符参数名称"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:65
#: cfdb96003e0444f6b831eb39da5cc04f
msgid "**param_value** : the new value for the parameter expressed as a float"
msgstr "**param_value**：以浮点数表示的参数新值"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:66
#: 4fd91a636b1742b3aa5b1c5be43b48a5
msgid ""
"**param_type** : the `MAV_PARAM_TYPE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_PARAM_TYPE>`__ for the "
"parameter.  This must match the type of the parameter within the AutoPilot "
"and will be MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT8, MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT16, MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT32 "
"or MAV_PARAM_TYPE_REAL32 (the only types that ArduPilot supports).  It may "
"be convenient to store the \"param_type\" field from the `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ message sent by "
"the flight controller for this parameter."
msgstr ""
"**param_type**：该参数的 `MAV_PARAM_TYPE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_PARAM_TYPE>`__。必须与飞控内部的参数类型一致，可选值为"
" MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT8、MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT16、MAV_PARAM_TYPE_INT32 或 "
"MAV_PARAM_TYPE_REAL32（ArduPilot 仅支持这些类型）。可以方便地将飞控发送的 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息中该参数的 "
"「param_type」 字段保存下来备用。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:68
#: 0c6a577b7ec541d69bead19111f6b187
msgid ""
"If the parameter value is successfully updated the vehicle will respond with"
" a `PARAM_VALUE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ "
"message with the \"param_value\" field set to the new value."
msgstr ""
"若参数值成功更新，飞行器将回应一条 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息，其中 "
"「param_value」 字段被设置为新值。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:70
#: 0882869b659c4923b093cb27b87490b6
msgid ""
"If the save is unsuccessful because the parameter is a read-only parameter "
"(like MISSION_COUNT), the vehicle will respond with **two** messages.  A "
"`PARAM_VALUE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ "
"message with the \"param_value\" field set to the new value and a follow-up "
"`PARAM_VALUE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ "
"with the \"param_value\" field set to the original value.  This odd "
"behaviour was implemented to deal with the bad behaviour of some GCSs that "
"would try over and over to set the parameter until they received the number "
"they were expecting."
msgstr ""
"若因参数为只读参数（如 MISSION_COUNT）导致保存失败，飞行器将回应 **两条** 消息：第一条 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息的 "
"「param_value」 字段设为新值，随后一条 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息的 "
"「param_value」 字段恢复为原值。这种奇特的行为是为了应对某些地面站反复尝试设置参数直到收到期望值的不当行为而实现的。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:73
#: b7366e300488496ba4e037064c8eee50
msgid "Hidden Parameters"
msgstr "隐藏参数"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:75
#: 0d2f6dc3ae2e440cb6ada5332a634d94
msgid ""
"In order to reduce the time spent downloading parameters, ArduPilot hides "
"parameters for some subsystems if they are disabled."
msgstr "为减少下载参数所花费的时间，ArduPilot 会在某些子系统被禁用时隐藏其参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:77
#: c8527d7f9bf64b078b82a941dd3dd63f
msgid ""
"For example, users can choose to use QuadPlane functionality in ArduPlane, "
"but Q_ENABLE is disabled by default so all its parameters are hidden.  Once "
"the Q_ENABLE parameter is set to \"1\" the remaining Q_xxx parameters become"
" visible."
msgstr ""
"例如，用户可以选择在 ArduPlane 中使用 QuadPlane 功能，但 Q_ENABLE 默认被禁用，因此其所有参数均被隐藏。一旦将 "
"Q_ENABLE 参数设置为 「1」，其余 Q_xxx 参数将变为可见。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-params.rst:79
#: 4556ca84f91d401bb89a85402b442b0e
msgid ""
"From a ground station or companion computer point of view this means that "
"the total number of parameters will change.  i.e. the `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ **param_count** "
"field may increase but also note that the **param_index** for a given "
"parameter may change.  This means it is best to not rely on the "
"**param_index** field."
msgstr ""
"从地面站或伴随计算机的角度来看，这意味着参数总数会发生变化。即 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 的 "
"**param_count** 字段可能增大，同时也要注意某个特定参数的 **param_index** 也可能改变。因此最好不要依赖 "
"**param_index** 字段。"
